    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nAs I know, there are no ways to parse a keycode into a dictionary.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nA function that can parse a keycode into a dictionary, examples:\r\n`<C-a>` -> `{mod={'ctrl'},key='A'}`\r\n`<Home>` -> `{mod={},key='Home'}`\r\n`<char-65>` -> `{mod={},key='A'}`\r\n\r\nMaybe even support parsing multiple keycodes at once, for example:\r\n`<C-a>B<char-67>` -> `{{mod={'ctrl'},key='A'},{mod={},key='B'}.{mod={},key='C'}}`",
